### Agregar un comentario a un job — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/addComment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "comment": "Comentario de prueba desde el API"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/addComment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "comment": "Comentario de prueba desde el API"
}

### Validación: sin jobId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/addComment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Comentario sin job"
}

### Validación: sin comment → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/addComment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1
}

### Validación: comment vacío (solo espacios) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/addComment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "comment": "   "
}
